{"id":2189,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>热血赛场燃青春，篮风逐梦展锋芒。近日，在学校“栋梁杯”篮球赛激烈角逐中，航院男篮、女篮代表队并肩出征、奋勇拼搏，历经多轮高强度比拼，双双突破重围、成功晋级八强，用过硬实力展现航空学子坚韧笃行、奋勇争先的精神风貌。</p><p>“栋梁杯”作为校内极具影响力的体育赛事，各院系强队云集，对抗激烈、竞争白热化。赛场上，航院男篮气势如虹、敢打敢拼。队员们攻防有序、战术清晰，快速突破、精准传接、强势卡位，每一次起跳投篮、每一次篮板争夺都全力以赴，在拉锯战中稳住节奏，凭借默契的团队配合接连拿下关键比分，稳步拿下晋级名额。</p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qLm-pZL4WfL4C8Mv4CDo7-aM4nVoR76sozvbUz-ioR7bLmv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1ybMSh7okyDozCYUlUiLRGbnRUPMNCPnRvaM4ffL4NbL8VFo7-sL467UzQFLzLDnRfVgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRCbMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10697&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B95D86962AD5009D416F1D7070A3993A/8B737DA6/136D0E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qL46pVUm-4MRC8UvmTRLzGPM8-aozV6koznfM874olCPLNC0gihFp2hmCIa0oSy4UShVMSy4L4-DMzU4M4C4MNlZMzWfU4NbM8n7M8MfL4AFLzf7nzM2M4nFLNlZnmMkgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRCbMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10697&e=.png\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qMzGpaUlLPoR9DLvmnfoR-4UlrRUlV62M878oz67MRTko7L0gihFp2hmCIa0LSysUSybLShRnlr7MlQRMzVRLRWfUlVfL8CDnl-anNCinmTFLNUsnzN4UNWFLz74MmT7gjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRCbMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10697&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/17A91CEED5FC51C02AAAA3F6EB0FF5F9/2D7E93BB/11369D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qL4Lp8nzC8o77bMvm7snRnVo7l8U4V6knRT2nzL8M7rfo7L0gihFp2hmCIa0USyPM1yaLkyaozUiM7MfnR-8olUZoRLsnmLanl78U8QRLlnFU8rfnm9ZLR6FLmrkolCZgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRCbMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10697&e=.png\"></div></td></tr><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qM8np7UzGDMRVRUvz-4MRr7ozlaM4U6aMl-4LzVVLzfkM4U0gihFp2hmCIa0LSy4USybLYyZnmLDnRf2LRVfL49PL4lDUlCaUmlaL7W7U4nFU4MkMR78nNWFnmQkMm9Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMmNsgtA8pU_cc&oid=185577612