c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10697&e=.png\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>整场赛事中，航院队员们始终秉持团结协作、永不言弃的竞技精神，不惧对抗、沉稳应战。场下教练精心部署、针对性调整战术，替补队员积极待命、加油助威，观众的呐喊助威响彻赛场，营造出热烈浓厚的赛事氛围。</p><p>此次男女篮双双挺进八强，是航院健儿日夜训练、蓄力拼搏的丰硕成果，也是老师们大力支持的结果。下一步，航院篮球队将复盘赛事得失，打磨技术细节、精进团队配合，向着更高目标稳步前行！</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qolCpbnzNbMzUaMvmA7MmMfnz9sM8Q6Rnl-bL8-ZozUbnz-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyioSyiLSy8Mm9DMm-an7MRnzM2nNCsnzWRMm67LlUYnRAFoRlYMlV7nmTFnmC8M77Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMmNsgtA8pU_cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10697&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/959514686620DCCE3FFF7E2C67D1D2D8/8525ADF9/F644A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qUz7p8L7lYUlCZMv8V7U4W2UmW2L7M67MRUDMzNbnNLPM870gihFp2hmCIa0nSyiMSy4nSysMzV2MmGPM7LYn7W2n7LboRl8MlnfUlVRM7nFoR-PnRTVUmWFLmUinNW7gjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRCbMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10697&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=qLm-pZL4WfL4C8Mv4CDo7-aM4nVoR76sozvbUz-ioR7bLmv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1ybMSh7okyDozCYUlUiLRGbnRUPMNCPnRvaM4ffL4NbL8VFo7-sL467UzQFLzLDnRfVgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRCbMYbw62_8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10697&e=.png"}